e him.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gPIc9O7S4fR1vecNmHb0rlfxRIe.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQmljY2hvby1LYS1LaGVsLSUyODIwMjAlMjktMTA4MHAv.1.4","title":"Paapi Devta","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2020-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After Akhil finds an important clue in Babu's suicide case, he investigates the suspects and confronts Anil Chaubey with substantial proof.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3HEY2qYg10IggINPXfTvaHtWEup.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQmljY2hvby1LYS1LaGVsLSUyODIwMjAlMjktMTA4MHAv.1.5","title":"Saanp seedhi ka khel","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2020-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Rashmi is proven to be the prime suspect in Anil Chaubey's murder. Akhil doubts that Rajveer and Goldy are involved in Munna Singh's murder. A decrypted call between Goldy and Rajveer proves Akhil's suspicion right.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6pZjLQsWvrNi5ADn9TuTZiEimE7.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQmljY2hvby1LYS1LaGVsLSUyODIwMjAlMjktMTA4MHAv.1.6","title":"Banaras to Beijing","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2020-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Rashmi tells Akhil about her conversation with Anil Chaubey. To prove her innocence, Akhil starts looking for supporting evidence which unearths a few key learnings.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dAwvDxa0UxOl7ZErEAkNWehasA1.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQmljY2hvby1LYS1LaGVsLSUyODIwMjAlMjktMTA4MHAv.1.7","title":"Mujhse Bura koi nahi","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2020-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Based on Akhil's evidence, court acquits Rashmi. Akhil manages to steer the investigation towards Rajveer and Goldy and hands over proof against them to Inspector Tiwari. Rashmi and Akhil get married.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5CsjvcPg5295p3BnXI1UA8KtT6G.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvQmljY2hvby1LYS1LaGVsLSUyODIwMjAlMjktMTA4MHAv.1.8","title":"Kaid Mein Hai Bulbul","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2020-11-18T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Tiwari informs Akhil about Rajveer lurking around his house. Rajveer kidnaps Rashmi, and Tiwari and Akhil pursue his trail to save Rashmi. Rajveer shoots himself before Akhil can find out Rashmi's whereabouts.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9GobEohMXV7BOykIQ3kvYexJwxK.jpg"}]}}